{"2594610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Echo", "steam_appid": 2594610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dying Earth, A silent planet,  A mission that went terribly wrong....</strong><br><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You awaken from cryosleep—stranded on Mars, years after a disaster scattered your crew.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mission to save humanity continues without you… but only you can finish it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• SURVIVE THE RED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and endure brutal dust storms. Oxygen, rad-shielding, and trust are your lifelines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/65209fbd428c5471be697b560e1a5435.poster.avif?t=1761720615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/65209fbd428c5471be697b560e1a5435.webm?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/65209fbd428c5471be697b560e1a5435.mp4?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• FIGHT OR VANISH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in tense third-person combat or use stealth and cunning to outsmart hostile factions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/4a9bf8d7f1a9cf62f5b9f5d378465905.poster.avif?t=1761720615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/4a9bf8d7f1a9cf62f5b9f5d378465905.webm?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/4a9bf8d7f1a9cf62f5b9f5d378465905.mp4?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• REBUILD HOPE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repair the broken Mars Project, forge uneasy alliances, and confront those who stole your legacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• CHOOSE YOUR TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision—friendship, betrayal, sacrifice—echoes across Mars and determines Earth’s survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/d6ee1d39e119ede18109a0f4d4524bce.poster.avif?t=1761720615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/d6ee1d39e119ede18109a0f4d4524bce.webm?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/d6ee1d39e119ede18109a0f4d4524bce.mp4?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• A CINEMATIC SCI-FI EXPERIENCE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather, day–night cycles, and lifelike performances deliver a world both beautiful and deadly.<br><br></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• AN EPIC STORY OF SURVIVAL AND REDEMPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jedda—a brilliant engineer and mother—uncover Mars’ secrets before the last human heartbeat fades.<br><br><br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;One of the most atmospheric survival shooters on the horizon.&quot;</i> — Early Press Preview<br></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to join the mission and keep Earth’s future alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/c9ba71aa809f061e330c5b9da90fa8ed.poster.avif?t=1761720615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/c9ba71aa809f061e330c5b9da90fa8ed.webm?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/c9ba71aa809f061e330c5b9da90fa8ed.mp4?t=1761720615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A dying Earth, A silent planet,  A mission that went terribly wrong....</strong><br><strong></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You awaken from cryosleep—stranded on Mars, years after a disaster scattered your crew.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The mission to save humanity continues without you… but only you can finish it.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>• SURVIVE THE RED WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and endure brutal dust storms. Oxygen, rad-shielding, and trust are your lifelines.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2594610/extras/65209fbd428c5471be697b560e1a5435.poster.avif?t=1761720615\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https: